        "id": 4269888
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-08T10:52:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`GPURequestCallbackRunnable\u003cT\u003e` treats `T` as a generic type, so it has no knowledge of the `@ErrorType` annotation due to type erasure. We cannot blindly check `result !\u003d ErrorType.NoError` because `T` could be any type. Even if `T` is an int, the generic class cannot distinguish between a valid numerical result and an error code.",
      "parentUuid": "47648ad7_051389b7",
      "revId": "e11aae943bc46518bc2561040b396853e09a4bc8",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
